    "culture": {
      "lesson": "Egyptians wrote stories on papyrus. This is one of the oldest adventure stories known, and its papyrus is kept in a museum in Russia.",
      "factCards": [
        "papyrus",
        "incense"
      ]
    },
    "moral": {
      "lesson": "Stay brave and calm when things go wrong; be thankful to those who help you. The Sailor thanks the Serpent in the only way the Serpent wants: by telling his story well.",
      "reflectionQuestion": "Who helped you once when you were afraid, and how did you thank them?"
    }
  },
  "moral": "When things go wrong, stay brave and thank those who help you.",
